---
// The paid full packs, sold on Gumroad. Buying one supports Gafira's
// development. Prices are the minimums set on Gumroad ("pay what you want"),
// except bundles, which have a fixed price; keep them in sync with the
// Gumroad listings.
//
// Each card shows its pack: the cover, then eight illustrations only the full
// version has, in a swipeable carousel. Any image opens the viewer, where it
// can be seen large and zoomed in to look at the detail.
//
// Motion: when a card is revealed its pack "opens" (the cover grows from a
// circle in the centre and comes into focus), then the "+N new" badge lands.
// While the section is on screen the buy buttons catch a light sweep a few
// times, and with a mouse a soft light follows the pointer while faint pack
// illustrations drift in depth behind the cards. Reduced motion keeps the
// content in place with no movement.
